      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "An old graveyard southeast of Fountainville holds a German‑inscribed marble stone honoring Abraham Fried, who died in 1772.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        14,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
